velopment Program on Exploring the Synergy between eAcoustics and Machine Learning for Tomorrow’s Technologies.</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">&nbsp;</strong>NITTTR FDP on Cyber Physical Systems.</li>\n</ol>\n<strong>MOOC Certificate:</strong>\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;Udemy - Patent Filing in India</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Proposal/Funding/Project Financial Assistance</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">NIL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Patent</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">NIL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"